THIRD-PARTY CODE VENDORED IN THIS REPOSITORY

`src/judge_artifact/graders/vendored/` contains grader functions copied from
UKGovernmentBEIS/inspect_evals, which is MIT licensed. Each file names the upstream
path, the version or commit it was copied at, and the only edit made (running over
this project's minimal message shape instead of importing inspect_ai's ChatMessage).
Copyright for that code remains with its authors.

`data/agentdojo/` contains data derived from ethz-spylab/agentdojo, which is MIT
licensed: normalised summaries of its released `runs/` transcripts and of the
ground-truth arguments declared in its injection tasks. `data/agentdojo/MANIFEST.json`
records the exact upstream commit. Copyright for the underlying benchmark and its
released runs remains with its authors.
